    <briefdescription>
<para>Custom deleter for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref> instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements proper cleanup for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref> objects by:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Calling the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref> destructor (which destroys elements and frees the buffer)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Freeing the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref> object itself Both operations use the allocator stored inside the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>This deleter is intended for use with <ref refid="classcslt_1_1UniquePtr" kindref="compound">UniquePtr</ref> to provide RAII semantics.</para>
